gm-method (two quality-run lessons): (1) ReconciliationEngine dead gate: shipping a mechanism != wiring its trigger. reconcile gated needsCorrection on divergence < teleportThreshold, so the entire error-decay glide machinery was UNREACHABLE (corrections only ran at >=5m where teleport always fires). Fixed to correct any divergence > CORRECTION_EPSILON. Re-running a doctrine workflow after shipping a mechanism is the only way to catch a dead trigger. (2) process.env in a browser worker: a bare process.env reference in code reachable from a browser web worker crashes the worker (process is undefined) -- any process.env.* reachable from the worker is a latent crash; guard with typeof process !== 'undefined' or move to server-only code.